{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tralalero Tralala vs Bombordiro Crocodilo, who to choose? It's a fighting game based on a famous meme: fight with your friends and win while playing as your favorite characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/gif1_eng.png?t=1747050125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/allhero2.gif?t=1747050125\" />Check out 8 cool heroes at the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your favorite, show off your skills and smash your friends in epic battles! Each hero has a unique animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/gif2_eng.png?t=1747050125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/bombardirowin.gif?t=1747050125\" />Combine attacks, block in time and use your ultimate to turn the tide of battle. Each fight is unique due to individual character animations and a wide variety of blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/gif3_eng.png?t=1747050125\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/selectgif.gif?t=1747050125\" /><br>Absolutely every character from a famous meme. Do you love tung tung tung sahur like me? Then pick him and bend absolutely everyone in your way!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337680?t=1747050125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337680?t=1747050125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor